        {
          "left": "80.0px",
          "top": "200.0px",
          "width": "634.0px",
          "height": "400.0px",
          "innerHTML": "<div style='font-family:\"Open Sans\", sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#333; line-height:1.8;'><p>Date: August 11, 2026</p><p style='margin-top:20px;'><strong>Ref: Booking Confirmation #GE-88492</strong></p><p style='margin-top:30px;'>Dear Mr. Harrison,</p><p style='margin-top:20px;'>It is with great pleasure that we confirm your upcoming stay at The Grand Empress. We have reserved our Presidential Suite for you, arriving on September 5th, 2026 and departing on September 10th, 2026.</p><p style='margin-top:20px;'>Our concierge team is at your full disposal to arrange dining reservations, transportation, or any bespoke experiences you may desire during your time with us.</p><p style='margin-top:20px;'>We look forward to welcoming you.</p><p style='margin-top:40px;'>Warm regards,</p><p style='margin-top:10px; font-family:\"Cinzel\", serif; font-size:18px;'>Victoria Sterling</p><p style='font-size:12px; color:#666;'>General Manager</p></div>",
          "transform": "none",
          "zIndex": 2,
          "scaleX": "1",
          "scaleY": "1"
        },
